Windows 11 Native Fluent Start Menu & Experience Center for Omarchy Hyprland
Features:
- Authentic Windows 11 Fluent Mica Glassmorphism & Solid Mode support
- Dynamic Dark / Light theme detection from Omarchy settings
- Instant real-time app search filter with Web Search fallback
- 6x3 Pinned Apps Grid with Windows 11 Fluent iconography
- "All apps >" Alphabetical A-Z App Drawer with instant search
- Recommended Documents & Quick Shortcuts section
- User Profile Strip with Account Lock & Sign Out
- Complete Power Hub: Lock, Sign Out, Sleep, Hibernate, Restart, Shut Down
- Auto-dismiss on focus loss, Escape key, or app launch
- Instant process toggle (single instance)

